# 📈 Real-Time Stock Market ETL Pipeline

![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.10-blue)
![PySpark](https://img.shields.io/badge/PySpark-3.5.1-orange)
![PostgreSQL](https://img.shields.io/badge/PostgreSQL-16-blue)
![Docker](https://img.shields.io/badge/Docker-Containerized-2496ED)
![ETL](https://img.shields.io/badge/Data%20Pipeline-Incremental-green)

An end-to-end incremental ETL pipeline that extracts stock market data from the Alpha Vantage API, processes it through a Medallion Architecture (Bronze → Silver → Gold) using PySpark, and loads analytics-ready data into PostgreSQL.

---

## 🚀 Features

* Extract stock market OHLCV data from Alpha Vantage API
* PySpark-based Bronze, Silver, and Gold transformations
* Incremental loading using checkpoint tracking
* PostgreSQL integration via JDBC
* Dockerized deployment
* Structured logging
* Duplicate prevention using multiple validation layers
* Analytics-ready Gold dataset

---

## 🏗️ Architecture

```text
Alpha Vantage API
        │
        ▼
┌─────────────────┐
│     EXTRACT     │
└────────┬────────┘
         ▼
┌─────────────────┐
│     BRONZE      │
│ Raw JSON Data   │
└────────┬────────┘
         ▼
┌─────────────────┐
│     SILVER      │
│ Data Quality    │
└────────┬────────┘
         ▼
┌─────────────────┐
│      GOLD       │
│ Business Metrics│
└────────┬────────┘
         ▼
┌─────────────────┐
│   PostgreSQL    │
└─────────────────┘
```

