## 🔄 Incremental Load Strategy

The pipeline only loads newly available records.

```text
checkpoint.json
        │
        ▼
Fetch recent window
        │
        ▼
Extract API data
        │
        ▼
Left Anti Join
(New records only)
        │
        ▼
Load PostgreSQL
        │
        ▼
Update checkpoint
```

### Duplicate Prevention

| Layer          | Technique             |
| -------------- | --------------------- |
| Extraction     | Date filtering        |
| Transformation | Left Anti Join        |
| Database       | Composite Primary Key |

