## ⚙️ Getting Started

### Prerequisites

* Docker Desktop
* Alpha Vantage API Key

### Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/wajid-rah/process_etl.git
cd process_etl
```

### Configure API Key

Update:

```json
config/config.json
```

with your Alpha Vantage API key.

### Build Containers

```bash
docker compose up -d --build
```

### Run Pipeline

```bash
docker compose exec pyspark_etl python main.py
```

